Assert-Contains "editor owns preview lifetime" $scenarioPreviewSessionHost 'IScenarioPreviewSession _current.*ShelteredScenarioRuntime\.BeginPreview.*_current\.Refresh.*current\.Dispose\(\)' "the editor host must own and dispose the API preview session instead of exposing fine-grained editor facades."
